## Wikipedia-derived pattern material

The numbered pattern catalog in `SKILL.md` adapts material from the English
Wikipedia project page; `references/preset-neutral-professional-de.md` adapts
material from its German counterpart:

- English: "Signs of AI writing"
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing
  Contributors and revision history:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing&action=history
